        "username": "Elijah_Vasylchenko",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/elijah_vasylchenko/{size}/156132_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-10-19T07:28:28.490Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone! I’m Illia, an automation engineer based in Ukraine (UTC+3). My hours fully overlap with Europe and with US mornings.</p>\n<p><strong>What I build in production:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Self-hosted n8n</strong> on Docker/Proxmox + PostgreSQL: backups, credentials in env vars, error workflows with Telegram alerts</li>\n<li><strong>LLM agents with Claude / OpenAI:</strong> email reply drafting with human approval, lead qualification, booking assistants (Telegram/WhatsApp)</li>\n<li><strong>Lead sourcing pipelines:</strong> SerpAPI → AI classification → personalization → email finding → Google Sheets/CRM, with deduplication and retries</li>\n<li><strong>Integrations:</strong> REST APIs, webhooks, scraping, JSON/CSV transforms</li>\n<li><strong>Fixing</strong> broken, slow or flaky workflows</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Recent example:</strong> an n8n pipeline that finds B2B companies matching a profile, classifies them with Claude Haiku, writes a personalized first line with Sonnet, finds the right email and logs everything to a sheet. Fully hands-off.</p>\n<p><strong>Availability:</strong> 10–20 h/week<br>\n<strong>Rate:</strong> $35/h, or a fixed price after a short scoping call<br>\n<strong>White-label for agencies:</strong> yes, NDA welcome<br>\n<strong>English:</strong> C2</p>\n<p><strong>My GitHub:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/elijahvasylchenko\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">elijahvasylchenko (Illia) · GitHub</a></p>\n<p>Reply here or DM me with what you want automated. I’ll answer with a concrete approach, not a generic pitch.</p>",
